[gd_scene format=3]

; The Voice Recognition Unit (NUS-020). The connector end is at -Z, where a
; controller plug's is, so a seated unit sits in the socket the same way; the
; body stands out of it and the cord to the microphone leaves at +Z.
;
; Sizes are estimated from photographs scaled against the N64's own controller
; connector -- no dimensioned drawing of this unit was found.

